# ML artifacts are COMMITTED on purpose (~1.4 MB total). A fresh clone has to demo
# correctly with no training step: without them the backend silently falls back to
# the rule-based classifier and the predictive-maintenance panel reads
# "unavailable" — a failure you would only discover on the backup laptop, on stage.
# Regenerate with: python ml/train.py

